{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":24,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 24:1"},"Be not thou envious against evil men, neither desire to be with them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 24:2"},"For their heart studieth destruction, and their lips talk of mischief. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 24:3"},"Through wisdom is an house builded; and by understanding it is established: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 24:4"},"And by knowledge shall the chambers be filled with all precious and pleasant riches. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 24:5"},"A wise man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," strong; yea, a man of knowledge increaseth strength. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 24:6"},"For by wise counsel thou shalt make thy war: and in multitude of counsellors ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," safety. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 24:7"},"Wisdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," too high for a fool: he openeth not his mouth in the gate. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 24:8"},"He that deviseth to do evil shall be called a mischievous person. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 24:9"},"The thought of foolishness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," sin: and the scorner ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"an abomination to men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 24:10"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["If"]}," thou faint in the day of adversity, thy strength ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," small. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 24:11"},"If thou forbear to deliver ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them that are"]}," drawn unto death, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["those that are"]}," ready to be slain; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 24:12"},"If thou sayest, Behold, we knew it not; doth not he that pondereth the heart consider ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it?"]}," and he that keepeth thy soul, doth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["not "]},"he know ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it?"]}," and shall ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["not"]}," he render to ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["every "]},"man according to his works? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 24:13"},"My son, eat thou honey, because ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," good; and the honeycomb, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which is"]}," sweet to thy taste: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 24:14"},"So ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall"]}," the knowledge of wisdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," unto thy soul: when thou hast found ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it,"]}," then there shall be a reward, and thy expectation shall not be cut off. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 24:15"},"Lay not wait, O wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man,"]}," against the dwelling of the righteous; spoil not his resting place: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 24:16"},"For a just ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," falleth seven times, and riseth up again: but the wicked shall fall into mischief. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 24:17"},"Rejoice not when thine enemy falleth, and let not thine heart be glad when he stumbleth: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 24:18"},"Lest the LORD see ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it,"]}," and it displease him, and he turn away his wrath from him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 24:19"},"Fret not thyself because of evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men,"]}," neither be thou envious at the wicked; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 24:20"},"For there shall be no reward to the evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man;"]}," the candle of the wicked shall be put out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 24:21"},"My son, fear thou the LORD and the king: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," meddle not with them that are given to change: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 24:22"},"For their calamity shall rise suddenly; and who knoweth the ruin of them both? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 24:23"},"These ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," also ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["belong"]}," to the wise. ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is "]},"not good to have respect of persons in judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 24:24"},"He that saith unto the wicked, Thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," righteous; him shall the people curse, nations shall abhor him: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 24:25"},"But to them that rebuke ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him"]}," shall be delight, and a good blessing shall come upon them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 24:26"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Every man"]}," shall kiss ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," lips that giveth a right answer. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 24:27"},"Prepare thy work without, and make it fit for thyself in the field; and afterwards build thine house. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 24:28"},"Be not a witness against thy neighbour without cause; and deceive ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["not"]}," with thy lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 24:29"},"Say not, I will do so to him as he hath done to me: I will render to the man according to his work. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 24:30"},"I went by the field of the slothful, and by the vineyard of the man void of understanding; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 24:31"},"And, lo, it was all grown over with thorns, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," nettles had covered the face thereof, and the stone wall thereof was broken down. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 24:32"},"Then I saw, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," considered ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," well: I looked upon ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it, and"]}," received instruction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 24:33"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Yet"]}," a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:33"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"34","sid":"PRO 24:34"},"So shall thy poverty come as one that travelleth; and thy want as an armed man. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 24:34"}]}]}
